        <title>从npc到主人翁，朋友就是最好的解药：蚊香猫猫船首航记</title>
        <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/%E4%BB%8Enpc%E5%88%B0%E4%B8%BB%E4%BA%BA%E7%BF%81%E6%9C%8B%E5%8F%8B%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%80%E5%A5%BD%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%A3%E8%8D%AF%E8%9A%8A%E9%A6%99%E7%8C%AB%E7%8C%AB%E8%88%B9%E9%A6%96%E8%88%AA%E8%AE%B0/</link>
